    {
      "id": "consent",
      "title": "Participant information and consent",
      "body": "**Document ID:** `consent_main`\n\n**Version:** `1.1.0`\n\n**Effective date:** 2026-10-25\n\n**Why we are asking**\n\nThis survey asks people who have used greedyQ about their experience. The feedback will help identify what works well and what should be improved.\n\n**What you will do**\n\nYou will answer questions about how you used greedyQ, your satisfaction, any problems you encountered, and what would make the product more useful. The survey takes about four minutes.\n\n**Risks and benefits**\n\nThis survey is expected to involve no more than minimal risk. You may skip optional written questions or stop at any time. You may not receive a direct benefit, but your feedback may help improve greedyQ.\n\n**Data and privacy**\n\nThe survey records your answers, the consent version, and operational timestamps needed to save and submit the survey. It does not ask for your name, email address, institution, IP address, browser fingerprint, credentials, or private research data. Please do not enter those details in written responses.\n\nResults should be reported in summary form. Because the survey does not ask for a lasting personal identifier, the team may be unable to locate an individual response after submission. During the survey, saving a withdrawal deletes the current session's research answers from the active greedyQ database.\n\n**Voluntary participation and withdrawal**\n\nTaking part is voluntary. You may decline or stop without penalty. Before submission, choose the withdrawal option if you do not want to continue. Once saved successfully, the session's answers and assignment are deleted; a minimal withdrawal record remains. Previously downloaded files and provider backups are outside this automatic deletion.\n\n**Contacts**\n\n- Study contact: `researcher@example.org`\n- Data or withdrawal questions: `data@example.org`\n\nThese addresses and governance details are placeholders for this reference example. They must be replaced and reviewed before real recruitment.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "consent_choice",
          "type": "mc",
          "label": "Do you consent to participate in this survey?",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Yes, I consent",
              "value": "yes"
            },
            {
              "label": "No, I do not consent",
              "value": "no"
            }
          ],
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "show_previous": false,
      "previous_mode": "hide",
      "next_mode": "show",
      "next_delay_seconds": 0,
      "next": "eligibility",
      "next_label": "Continue",
      "routes": [
